      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Prada Bonnie mini bag features a compact horizontal silhouette with an arched top handle, while the wraparound belt and metal buckle are inspired by the brand's iconic belt designs. Crafted from glossy waxed leather, the leather corner guards lend a vintage touch, and the refined design exudes an effortless versatility.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
