      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "First introduced in late 2023, the Prada Bonnie bag is defined by its elongated, compact East-west silhouette, slender handle, wraparound belt, and side knot details, blending functionality with a modern geometric aesthetic.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/2lwm1fi/592bc775b98a1224.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/2lwm1fi/592bc775b98a1224.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag borrows the structure of a classic briefcase, with an architectural rectangular silhouette, a top handle, and a zip closure. The symmetrical center seam evokes tailored uniforms, creating a clean, sharp presence.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
