    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The mini Bonnie is a new style for the Spring/Summer 2026 season, with compact dimensions of 12×23.5×9cm. It retains the series' signature design elements but replaces the original long handle with a short top handle, perfectly complementing the petite silhouette and adding a lively, whimsical feel.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
