      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Despite its mini size, the Bonnie still offers excellent storage. The interior is lined with red logo-print nylon, which is lightweight and scratch-resistant, and the top zip glides smoothly.",
